<item>
            <title>[LU-20312] backport kernel 6.16 compatibility to 2.17</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20312</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Port &lt;a href=&quot;https://review.whamcloud.com/60619&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/60619&lt;/a&gt; to lustre 2.17. Needed for build against RHEL 10.2. We are using lustre 2.17 on our RHEL 10 based OS.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;backport on original issue &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19249&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19249&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment>TOSS 6 based on RHEL 10.2&lt;br/&gt;
kernel 6.12.0-211.16.1.el10_2.x86_64&lt;br/&gt;
lustre-2.17.0_1-llnl &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/llnl/lustre/tree/2.17.0_1-llnl&quot;&gt;https://github.com/llnl/lustre/tree/2.17.0_1-llnl&lt;/a&gt;</environment>
